      "html": "<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><div><h1 class=\"font-display text-2xl text-ink-900\">Takrorlash studiyasi</h1><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-500\">Synthetic revision</p></div><a href=\"/app/listening/attempts/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002\" class=\"btn-secondary \" data-back-to-analysis=\"true\">Tahlilga qaytish</a></div><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-500\">Imtihondan keyingi hamma narsa: xatolaringiz, parafraza jadvali, tezlik mashqi va MCQ Mastery.</p><div class=\"card p-5 \" data-mistake-map=\"true\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg text-ink-900\">Xatolar xaritasi</h2><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-300\">Faqat sizning baholangan javoblaringizdan hisoblanadi.</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-ink-500\" data-mistake-empty=\"true\">Hozircha baholangan xato yo&#x27;q — avval urinishni tugatasiz.</p></div><div class=\"card p-5 \" data-keyword-table=\"true\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg text-ink-900\">Kalit so&#x27;zlar va parafrazalar</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-ink-300\">Eshitishingiz kerak bo&#x27;lgan kalit so&#x27;z va aytilgan bilan so&#x27;ralgan o&#x27;rtasidagi farq.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-ink-500\" data-keywords-empty=\"true\">Bu test uchun hali kalit so&#x27;zlar kiritilmagan.</p></div><div class=\"card p-5 \" data-speed-unlocked=\"true\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg text-ink-900\">Tezlik mashqi</h2><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-300\">Yozuvni imtihondagidan tezroq qo&#x27;ying — bemalol, shoshilmasdan.</span></div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"/api/resources/synthetic.mp3\" class=\"mt-3 w-full\" data-speed-audio=\"true\"></audio><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-300\">Tezlik</span><button type=\"butto